OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with good clear spells for many
OL,7,Fareas through the evening and
OL,8,Fovernight. Cloud builds late on
OL,9,Fparticularly in the west but remaining
OL,10,Fdry for most. Winds slowly easing.
OL,11,FTemperatures around average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloud thickens during the
OL,14,Fearly morning, but breaks widely by
OL,15,Fthe afternoon to leave sunny spells
OL,16,Fand dry conditions away from the
OL,17,Fcoast. Light winds. Temperatures just
OL,18,Fabove average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
