OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FVariable cloud and sunny spells on
OL,7,FThursday and Friday. Potential for
OL,8,Fmist and fog developing overnight then
OL,9,Fclearing slowly. Cloudier but mostly
OL,10,Fdry Saturday. Winds becoming light.
OL,11,FMild by day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
